WEBVTT

00:02:57.298 --> 00:03:00.134
no matter what people or life
may throw at you.

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:04.096
Now I'm going to give you
a little bit of background about myself.

00:03:05.139 --> 00:03:08.601
Funny enough, I was actually voted
most likely to be famous

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.770
in both middle school and high school.

00:03:13.272 --> 00:03:15.358
Now I know what you're thinking.
I'm sorry.

00:03:15.358 --> 00:03:18.736
I haven't always been this good looking,
it takes a little bit of time.

00:03:18.736 --> 00:03:19.904
(Laughter)

00:03:20.321 --> 00:03:25.159
My goal was to graduate high school
and to immediately blow up.

00:03:25.201 --> 00:03:26.911
But that didn't happen.

00:03:27.745 --> 00:03:29.789
So I went to college

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.292
and as soon as I went to college,
boy, did life hit me hard.